<sect1 id="compare_floats_8h_1motivation">
<title>Motivation</title><para>Specialized visitor that allows the use of CVFEM_MathOperators. Initially used for consistency checks for development of CVFEM scheme. Currently not in use. Could be used in future as replacement for FV calculations</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="classcsmp_1_1_upwind_control_visitor_1usage">
<title>Usage</title><para>To be used within the CVFEM scheme (Weis et al., Geofluids, 2014).</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">Can<sp/>assemble<sp/>PDE_operators<sp/>in<sp/>the<sp/>same<sp/>way<sp/>as<sp/>the<sp/>PDE_integrator.</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="classcsmp_1_1_upwind_control_visitor_1dependencies">
<title>Dependencies</title><para><ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_c_v_f_e_m___math_operator_l_h_s" kindref="compound">CVFEM_MathOperatorLHS</ref> <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_c_v_f_e_m___math_operator_r_h_s" kindref="compound">CVFEM_MathOperatorRHS</ref></para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="classcsmp_1_1_upwind_control_visitor_1issues">
<title>Known issues</title></sect1>
<sect1 id="compare_floats_8h_1testing">
<title>Testing</title><para>testing was done in the period before publication in 2014. </para>
</sect1>
